WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.287
The Hogue Commission on Foreign Interference.

00:00:03.237 --> 00:00:12.125
Justice Hogue's final report identified the People's Republic of China as the most active foreign interference perpetrator in Canadian elections.

00:00:12.125 --> 00:00:21.225
The Commission found that CIJA lobbied 56 percent of sitting MPs, and that foreign interference had become systemic rather than episodic.
